Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(profilo):=20profilo=20del=20proprietario?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20con=20il=20nome=20in=20alto=20e=20la=20campanella=20nell'ang?=
 =?UTF-8?q?olo;=20via=20=C2=ABI=20tuoi=20dati=C2=BB?=
